body: "buildJql() composes filters into one ordered, value-quoted JQL; readJqlFilters reads kebab+camel. Date values force-quoted (Jira parses bare -7d as arithmetic). Wired into runImport + jira-sync importer. Unit tests cover verbatim --jql, defaults, composition, status->statusCategory, quoting/escaping. Functionally verified via dry-run."
